# The two hero/philosophy clips ARE committed — about 7 MB between them.
#
# They used to be ignored and pulled by `npm run assets:fetch`, which fetches
# from https://velocity-labs-revamp.vercel.app — the deployment this project
# exists to replace. That was fine while the only consumer was a developer
# cloning the repo, and wrong the moment the site started building in CI: every
# deploy would depend on someone else's site still being up, and the day it is
# taken down the hero loses its video with no warning.
#
# 7 MB is nothing against GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, and a repo that builds
# from its own contents is worth far more than the space. `assets:fetch` still
# works and is still how you refresh them from source.
